2238efe34 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-9ksg7z-b437d951d17c388d9de45102238efe34 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-7q0oq7-acc44609b60209b814d146bacc968e4a sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-7q0oq7-acc44609b60209b814d146bacc968e4a av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-6f3atr-1485ebf89e40a24458b6d2d2c8472cae '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2234\">Del 19 al 22 de mayo de 2026, participaremos en Automechanika Istanbul, uno de los eventos m\u00e1s importantes de la industria automotriz a nivel mundial.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2454\">Este encuentro internacional re\u00fane a miles de expertos, fabricantes y socios comerciales de Europa, Asia y Oriente Medio. La feria es una excelente oportunidad para conocer las \u00faltimas tendencias del sector automotriz.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2532\">Le invitamos a visitar nuestro stand y hablar sobre posibles colaboraciones.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2612\">Cu\u00e1ndo: <strong>19\u201322.05.2026<\/strong><br data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2562\" \/>D\u00f3nde: <strong>Estambul, Turqu\u00eda<\/strong><br data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2593\" \/>Stand: <strong>11D125<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2630\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\u00a1Nos vemos all\u00ed!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-4lxenz-2921860d282560c